  "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>ATME college of organized celebration of 67th Kannada Rajyotsava on 29 November 2022.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The celebrations started lighting the lamp with offering flower to the Kannada Raja-Rajeswari by dignitaries and the guests. State anthem was recited by the students and staff.The chief guest of the event was Prof Veerendra kumar Former HOD of Dept.CSE ATMECE.He gave an insightful talk which explained the rich heritage of this proud state Karnataka. Dr. Jagadeeshkumar Former Hod Dept of Mathmatics.spoke about the beauty and simplicity of Kannada language and encouraged students to learn Kannada. He also emphasised on the importance of learning Kannada.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Report-on-Kannada-Rajyotsava-2022-1.pdf\"><b>[pdf-embedder url=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Report-on-Kannada-Rajyotsava-2022.pdf\" title=\"Report on Kannada Rajyotsava-2022\"]</b></a></span></p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->",
